NAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":3334097778,"text":"キュー！","nextNodeIds":[751770132]},{"nodeId":751770132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3566487826,"text":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}…","nextNodeIds":[751770133]},{"nodeId":751770133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":85546146,"text":"きっと、自分だけの冒険を始めたいんだよ…","nextNodeIds":[751770134]},{"nodeId":751770134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2523343058,"text":"えっ、なんだよ、自分だけの冒険って…オ、オイラたちとは一緒に旅をしたくないのか？うぅ…オイラ、なんか嫌なことでも言っちゃったか…？","nextNodeIds":[751770135]},{"nodeId":751770135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2379776842,"text":"食いしん坊だなんてもう言わないから、ずっと一緒にいようぜ…な？","nextNodeIds":[751770136]},{"nodeId":751770136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":3403412970,"text":"キュ…","nextNodeIds":[751770137]},{"nodeId":751770137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1559083034,"text":"…パイモン。","nextNodeIds":[751770138]},{"nodeId":751770138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1939380258,"text":"うぅ…分かってる、分かってるよ…ちびもいつか大きくなるんだ。こいつにも、行くべき場所があるって…","nextNodeIds":[751770139]},{"nodeId":751770139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4064393466,"text":"それでも、いきなり離れるって言われたら、寂しいに決まってるだろ…","nextNodeIds":[751770140]},{"nodeId":751770140,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2716137130,"text":"大丈夫、きっとまた会える…","nextNodeIds":[751770141]},{"nodeId":751770141,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2648692338,"text":"#ほんとか？これから、うぅ…これからオイラたちが助けを求めたら、{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}、絶対にすぐ駆けつけるんだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[751770142]},{"nodeId":751770142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":2940971786,"text":"キュイッ！","nextNodeIds":[751770143]},{"nodeId":751770143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1328233554,"text":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}も冒険で困ったことがあったら、すぐにオイラたちのところに来るように！もちろん、無理するのもダメだ！","nextNodeIds":[751770144]},{"nodeId":751770144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":1355894354,"text":"キュイッ！キュイッ！","nextNodeIds":[751770145]},{"nodeId":751770145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":684371786,"text":"…それと、あまり食べ過ぎないこと。倒せないデカブツに遭遇したらすぐに逃げること。あと、食べ過ぎはダメだけど、食べるべきお肉もしっかり食べること…","nextNodeIds":[751770146]},{"nodeId":751770146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":969797418,"text":"それと、なによりも！いっちばん大事なのは——","nextNodeIds":[751770147]},{"nodeId":751770147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2226089458,"text":"元気に育ってくれること…","nextNodeIds":[751770148]},{"nodeId":751770148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2628974042,"text":"そう、ちゃんと大きくなること。山と同じぐらいにな！","nextNodeIds":[751770149]},{"nodeId":751770149,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":21460,"speakerName":"#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}","textMapHash":3847914546,"text":"キュウ、キュウ、キュイッ！","nextNodeIds":[751770150]},{"nodeId":751770150,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3458579538,"text":"うぅ…その意気だ！絶対…絶対にオイラたちのこと、忘れちゃダメだからな…！","nextNodeIds":[751770151]},{"nodeId":751770151,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":865462610,"text":"静かな森の中、あなたは別れを惜しみながらブレイズ・ミートシチューを一緒に味わい、時折訪れていたキャンプ場を片付けた。\\nそして、これから独りで旅に出る仲間のために、道中で手に入れた思い出の品を整理しながら、今までに起きたことを思い返す——洞窟の入口を塞いでいたユムカ竜に、海辺のプクプク獣、それからナタで出会った個性豊かな人々…","nextNodeIds":[751770152]},{"nodeId":751770152,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":1754306194,"text":"その後…あの金の文字を送ってきた謎の存在が脳裏をよぎった。\\n「あいつ、一度も姿を見せなかったな。オイラたち、きっと利用されたに違いないぞ。」とパイモンは愚痴っていたが…\\nそれを聞いてふと、トゥラン聖山の底で見た成長した竜の姿を思い出す。\\n複雑な感情を浮かべていたあの瞳…この子もいつか、あんな風に立派な姿に成長するのだろうか。","nextNodeIds":[751770153]},{"nodeId":751770153,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":580561610,"text":"目の前の仔竜は最後、角でパイモンの額にそっと触れ、それからあなたの手のひらに優しく頬をすり寄せた。\\nそして、まるで自らを奮い立たせるかのように——","nextNodeIds":[751770154]},{"nodeId":751770154,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"","textMapHash":4277152618,"text":"幼い竜は決然と背を向け、ゆっくりと去っていった。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":751770118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1037841354,"text":"うん、撮ろう！","nextNodeIds":[751770119]},{"nodeId":751770108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":116623074,"text":"「ミートシチュー・ブレイズ」！","nextNodeIds":[751770109]},{"nodeId":751770109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":277904258,"text":"その響き、思い出すな…","nextNodeIds":[751770110]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7517701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[3,90],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"[3_11297:-1325.908,-5.892,7516.207]"}],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133504650,1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133504184,3"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133504198,3"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["3","133504504,3"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_REFRESH_GROUP_SUITE"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["7500003","1"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_SET_QUEST_GLOBAL_VAR"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLN